            "review_text": "LPN\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam82 contributions\n0\nGet the lamb\nSep 2018 • Family\nThis restaurant has existed for a very long time and is a mix between western and Chinese cuisine. It is well known among locals but hardly any expats or tourists know of it. While expensive, the food here is quite good. I recommend getting the lamb chops. Service is excellent.\nWritten August 16, 2019",
