            "review_text": "AntoniD775\nVienna7 contributions\n0\nOne of the oldest restaurants ....\nNov 2017\nI love this place because it didn't change over the years, food taste great and the qualtiy is always good. It is one of the oldest restaurant in town, for local people they also call it \" French restaurant \" but it is more foodfusion. I think the also have loyal service people as I always meet the same waiter there for years now. Make reservation if you would like to experience this place\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 18, 2018",
