            "review_text": "Bibimaru\nVietnam117 contributions\n1\nPricey with uninformed charges\nMar 2018 • Family\nI really dislike posting a negative review on TripAdvisor but still have to talk about this one. The restaurant has been operating for 30 years or more, I havent come for such a long time. It's very popular within local community. The food was OK, some dishes are nice, some are not. The price is quite high, we spent 1.5mil VND for 4 persons without alcohol, for 2 soups, 2 baked clams, 1 beef spaghetti, 1 chicken rice, 1 stir fried chicken liver and soft drinks. What irritated me was that they charged the wet hot towels that they gave us 2 times, when we came in and during the meal, without informing us these towels are not complimentary. At the end we agreed to pay this extra 60,000 VND , the amount was never a problem, I just really hate the way they intentionally did not inform any of us. Not coming back, for sure.\nRead more\nWritten March 12, 2018",
