            "review_title": "Review at Thien Nam Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Jennifer T\nSingapore, Singapore135 contributions\n0\nOld school French/Chinese restaurant\nApr 2017 • Friends\nGot a treat at this restaurant from the \"good old days\". The deco is a bit sparse and old, but the waiters were all young. We had kidney cream soup, clams baked in cheese, deep-fried soft shell crabs, roast pigeon, and chicken stuffed with rice. They were all tasty. It's a bit pricey but will go back again for the atmosphere. And apparently some really famous people go there.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 4, 2017",
