            "review_title": "Review at Thien Nam Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Kevin W Chan\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia305 contributions\n0\nExcellent Food Great Family Dining Experience!\nMar 2017\nThis is an old establishment - it has been around for 60-70+ years as according to the owner. I have no doubt on it - as the customers all seemed like old customers for generations.\nThe food here (either Western or Oriental) are truly excellent! The taste is good, the choices are aplenty!\nThe service is attentive. The waiters also are very friendly.\nThe pricing is towards the mid-range and middle-upper range depending on what you ordered. But the price is woth its value, as the food is truly authentic and great!\nIt is worth a visit - especially if you are 'history buff' as well, as the owner can tell you stories of how the atmosphere outside of the restaurant during the fall of Saigon (in war era)... I am glad it still stands strong today!\nIt could be very packed on weekends, do make reservation!\nRead more\nWritten March 2, 2017",
